  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n * #3961 - allow hyphens in tags (@smemsh)\r\n * #4111 - Git sync (@carmiac)\r\n * #4127 - Dependency performance improvement (@ashprice)\r\n * #4136 - Burndown performance improvement (@ashprice)\r\n * #4124 - Move default theme into a dedicated file (@dud-eisme)\r\n * #4144 - Fix handling of `scheduled` in recurring tasks (@ashprice, @scompo)\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @daeho-ro made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/3976\r\n* @gonsoos made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/3998\r\n* @raine made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/4044\r\n* @silanai made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/4057\r\n* @Manar-Elhabbal7 made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/4072\r\n* @sznicolas made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/4091\r\n* @carmiac made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/4111\r\n* @dud-eisme made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/4124\r\n* @ashprice made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/4127\r\n* @Yurii201811 made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/4145\r\n* @floze-the-genius made their first contribution in https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/pull/4167\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/GothenburgBitFactory/taskwarrior/compare/v3.4.2...v3.5.0",
